Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone needs to scout ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking this guy out\Nfirst is our best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're more than up\Nfor this little mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Masa, he's already on the radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him escape\Nnow, especially here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to breathe, but I\Ndon't want to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to breathe, but I\Ndon't want to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find out this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido Mista's outlook on life has\Nalways been summarized by the saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,simple is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He found joy in the banality\Nof sleep, the sway of branches,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the smooth creeping of clouds, the\Naroma of wine, the texture of formaggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He would flirt with a beautiful\Ngirl despite her disapproval.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he needed money, he'd\Nwait outside the theater?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For some poor soul to\Nslander the featured actor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and beat them for every\Nlast lira they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But sometimes the beatdown befell him,\Nstopping only with police intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It had its ups and downs, but Mista\Nconsidered his life a happy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Some might have called\Nthis foolish naivete
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the mind of Mista\Nit was simple calculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Overanalyzing was the bedfellow of fear\Nand fear wasn't part of the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon after Mista\Nturned 17 something changed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,his view on life he came to the conclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that The destiny of every\Nsoul is set in youth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,one may feel helplessly\Nstuck that nothing feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,straightforward or easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end we all travel down\Nthe path we are supposed to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a clear summer's night and\NMista was on his usual passeggiata.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Mista! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You ladies want to party tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry doll, but we got other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why would I do that you little slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking in, he could see\Na nearly nude woman being
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,assaulted blood was gushing\Nfrom her nose and mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And she was nearly unconscious the urge\Nto not get involved was strong yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His instincts had taken over, causing\Nhis body to spring into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if a shooter fired within close\Nproximity, it wouldn't guarantee a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a state of panic and momentary fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the shooter could easily fire the gun\Nwithout having acquired proper aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The aggressor let out two shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Both bullets grazed Misa's arm\Nbefore fading into the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you freaking weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, four, five, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Each bullet was somehow\Nswallowed up in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,His accomplices frantically fired, but\Nin what can only be called a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,not a single bullet struck Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista was surprised by his ability to\Nkeep calm in this torrent of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy? Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista grabbed a gun\Nalong with some bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and despite the volley heading his\Nway, Cooley loaded the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a nurse sliding the\Nsyringe into a bulging vein,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he pulled the trigger\Ncalmly and deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He took aim and fired four perfect shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd never taken another\Nman's life before that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,yet he felt no hesitation or regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In a moment of hopelessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista found the strength to cut through\Nthe darkness that gripped his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the driver is\Nthe real owner of the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell before, but\Nhis right leg isn't injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to off you, but now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's twice now you shot\Nme, you gun-toting psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll be sure\Nto take better aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what kind of lame-ass line was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What I should have said is, how\Nare you not a pile of sausage meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot your ugly mug square on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that the bullet\Njust missed his brain somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Mista, that last-ish\Neffort of yours was quite endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Mista is your name, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems even your friends are on this\Nbeautiful island enjoying the sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But only you have gazed upon my visage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You fooled me with that radio booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And you even nailed me\Nwith two cheap shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that we're face to face, and\NI'm armed with my sand arts and crafts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can knock down any bullet fired from that\Nridiculous peashooter you point around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I can't say I was\Npaying attention back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How many bullets did\Nyou fire off? Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fairly certain you\Nfired four on this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shot off two\Nback at that dumpy shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I did a good job counting, huh, mi-star?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can get in nice\Nand close and beat the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,shit out of you without\Na care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's right. I gotta reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with my hand? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like it's stuck to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the brakes, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I wanna, but I\Nneed some help over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, kid, you gotta help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponder it for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I'd go to the trouble\Nof telling you that you were out of ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the goodness of my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because I knew you'd crash and\Nburn with this truck, so why hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your driver can't take his foot off the\Ngas, and his hands aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only telling you all\Nthis because I know full well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't reload with your\Nhand fixed to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the bullets that\NBastardo's stand deflected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're frozen in mid-air,\Nlike in suspended animation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,moving in tandem with the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have immobilized\Nthe bullets with his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he cemented me\Nand the driver to this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His ability lets him freeze objects\Nin the exact place he touches them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why my bullet never made\Nit past the skin on his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:09:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course a surface wound\Nwouldn't finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Mista,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm honest, I couldn't be happier\Nthat you decided to take off after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy, in fact, that I'm willing to\Nforgive this little scratch you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,till now, no one knew for sure whether\NPopo's great treasure even existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been a desperate rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ferocity with which you're\Ntrying to kill me proves it exists!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You, friend, just reignited my hopes\Nand gave me a brand new reason to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save her every\Nsingle moment of swiping
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that sweet lira from\Nthat creature Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I can knock away your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,petty bullets like the\Nannoyance as they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What, there was another\Nbullet in the shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand allows him to fire two\Nbullets in a single shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I still have a\Nchance to work my magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'd do without\Nyou guys, number six and seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your fuckly ass is out of the\Nway, our worries just became roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I let that bullet-brained\Nasshole get me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, he'll die for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That 10 billion lira is going to be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be a way to beat\Nhim, but it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to dig deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista and the enemy must be in some\Nkind of car, heading to higher ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I even be able to\Nmake it there in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Four bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the unholy hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I only have four bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make a\Nlick of freaking sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you dropped one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you dropped the other bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you of all people should\Nknow the number four is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't load four bullets into the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My feet are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can stop this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But a little while ago, you were\Nscreaming at me to stop the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I changed my mind, so deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be a good driver and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to take me\Nto Marina Grande. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a friend waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be another\Nway for us to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I promise I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even make it up to you later. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My bullets only go skin\Ndeep with this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't inflict any major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He can also fix things in place,\Nmaking this an uphill battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could just get a bullet in his mouth,\Nhe couldn't defend himself from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It might actually kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I only have four bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to get stuck with that number.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Three would have been way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he looks like\Nand how he fights now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I should book it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head back to the harbor\Nand reconvene with Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bunch of extra\Nammo back there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When did he climb up the cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the truck! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop the damn truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a maniac again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Miesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,if you thought I'd just let\Nyou tell your friends about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're an even bigger\Nlummox than I took you for!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he can hold rocks in the air\Njust like he did the bullets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have used them like\Na ladder to get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you\Nstop the truck, you ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to step on it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so much as slow down, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is how you want to settle\Nthings, then come and get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dick noodle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive this truck like\Nyour life depends on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A few light taps will do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised what a\Nlittle steady tapping can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Power tends to accumulate\Nat the point of fixation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best not to strike at full tilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Proper aim becomes\Nunattainable and projects
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the vector of one's\Nprojectile to the opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, the release!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It came right back to you, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your bullets fly out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Those little stands of\Nyours are a bit unruly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't take a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need are a few taps and a\Ntiny bit of force to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very much like\Nentering SOS in Morse code.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The aim's not perfect, and it's not great\Non things that can't seem to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've finally reached the\Nperfect moment to end your existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My luck is totally shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Four has never been a good number,\NEven as a kid, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know what you're gonna\Nget when it shows its ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the other numbers\Nare there to pick up the slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one shot left, which must\Nmean the worst is behind me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky number one, don't fail me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Number five, number six,\Nlet's do the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we can end this prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our last shot, boys,\Nso we have to make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop the pathetic\Nbravado act, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trigger-happy days are over, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what your\Nbullet-riding stooges
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,can do or how many of\Nthem you shoot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At this distance, I can do\Nwhatever the hell I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can protect myself\Nand have time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you should know by now that it's\Nutterly impossible to best me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, loudmouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I said I had one bullet left in\Nthis chamber, would you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've still got one shot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I shoot this off and you\Nmanage to knock it away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll be out of bullets\Nand completely at your mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out sooner or\Nlater, so I lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I screw up this last\Nshot, you'd know anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of ammo after this, so I thought\Nyou'd appreciate my being up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But honestly, whether or not I botch\Nthis play is still up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, if we're being real with\Nourselves, we both know you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on\Nspewing nonsense, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Prattle on about your\Nsilly bullets all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can shoot one or a\Nhundred of those at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're never gonna\Nbe able to bring me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it wasn't nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll drop your guard soon enough,\Nthere's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially since you know\NI only have one shot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're full of it, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, he's gonna use his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We got one target!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So put your backs into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're aiming for the inside\Nof my mouth, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He just opened his mouth for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what they say about gift horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit him in the kisser!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that hurts a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that's exactly where\Nyou were going to aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's common sense to aim for the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My powered anchor objects would\Nbe rendered useless inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fending off your attack would suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd open my\Nmouth for you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the guy can even stop\Nbullets with his mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Urgh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This hurts more than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sil, I guess you were telling the truth\Nwhen you said that would be your last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem so eager to shoot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to that Kinoto spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you got, then allow me to\Nshow off the firepower on this beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally ready for launch, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on this, and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista's plan really worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew it was out of ammo\Nand let his guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like they always\Nsay, the closer the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we're at point-blank range,\Nour aim is even better than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When could they have... Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to all, fellas! Aim... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Artsy Crafts! Guard up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He split it in two?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I could take another\Ndirect hit, but there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be aiming for that, could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me he isn't really shooting for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His target!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I aimed at the bullet hole from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting the previous bullet head on\Nforced it deeper inside your skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's on a one-way\Ncollision course with your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck anchoring that, dopey dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But like I said, I'm out of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So if it doesn't kill you, I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you give it a rest\Nalready, number three?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you\Nto stop badgering number five?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he's still hanging on, with\Na bullet to the brain no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your stand really is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:21:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Bucciarati told me\Nnot to kill you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take me back to the Harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And what were you two doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.82,0:21:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass shits!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the truck, driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it, driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't some taxi, stronzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You assholes don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I let you off easy, but if I ever\Nsee you again, you're gonna pay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to intrude, but we have to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm after someone and need you to take\Nme to the top of the island right now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll just sit there we have to go\Nyou are planning to help me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:21:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up feeling so horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.90,0:22:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you won't give it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you won't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind. All I\Nwant to do is free you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say, what must I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to show how much I'm going to free you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say, what must I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to show how much I'm going to free you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.30,0:24:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
